:: slaveDemand
<<if _slaves[_demandIndex]>>\
    <span id="slaveDemand">\
        <<set _slave to _slaves[_demandIndex]>>
        _slave.name <<if _slave.fear gte 30>>cautiously<</if>> approaches, looking at you with _slave.possessive _slave.eyeColor eyes, and says:
        <<switch _slave.need>>\
            <<case "hunger">>\
                <<if _slave.hunger gte 75>>\
                    "<<if _slave.age gte 5>>Please!!! I'm so hungry!!! <<emoji 🙁>><<else>>"I'm hungryyyyyy!!! <<emoji 😢>><</if>>"
                <<else>>\
                    "I'm hungry... <<emoji 🙁>>"
                <</if>>\
        <</switch>>\
        <<set _demandInteraction to "slaveDemand" + _slave.need.toUpperFirst()>>
        <span id='hKeyAct'>\
            <<button '✅ (H) Handle'>>
                <<set $npc to _slaves[_demandIndex]>>
                <<openNpcInteraction _demandInteraction>>
            <</button>>\
        </span><span id='iKeyAct'>\
            <<button '❌ (I) Ignore'>>\
                <<set _demandIndex++>>
                <<replace #slaveDemand>><<include slaveDemand>><</replace>>
            <</button>>
        </span>
    </span>\
<</if>>\
:: basement
<<scenery basement>>
You are currently in your basement.
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <<set _slaves = Basement.getDemandingSlaves()>>\
    <<set _demandIndex to 0>>\
    <<include slaveDemand>>\
    <div class="row">\
        <div class="one-half column">\
            <<if $slaves.length > 0>>\
                Approach slave:
                <<set _slaveIndex to 0>>\
                <<for _slave range $slaves>>\
                    <<set _genderSymbol = _slave.gender != 'male'?'♀':'♂'>>\
                    <<emoji _genderSymbol>>\
                    <<print "<<link '_slave.name (_slave.age y.o. _slave.hairColor hair)'>><<set $npc to " + JSON.stringify(_slave) + ", $npc.index to " + _slaveIndex + ">><<openNpcInteraction slave>><</link>>">>
                    <<set _slaveIndex++>>\
                <</for>>\
            <</if>>\
        </div>\
        <div class="one-half column">\
            <<set _availableBeds to Basement.availableBeds()>>
            <<if _availableBeds <= 0>>\
                There's no more room for more slaves. You need to buy Mattresses if you want more.
            <<else>>\
                There's room for <<- _availableBeds>> more slave<<if _availableBeds gt 1>>s<</if>>.
            <</if>>\
        </div>\
    </div>
    /*<<keyOption "Go back upstairs" main 🚪>>*/\
    <<keyAction "Go back upstairs" 🚪>>
        <<run
            $slaves.forEach(slave => {
                slave.aroused = false;
            });
        >>
        <<goto main>>
    <</keyAction>>
    <<include workOption>>\
<</unlessEmergency>>\
:: slaveApproach
You approach $npc.name.
<<include npcStats>>
<<if $npc.fear gt 90>>\
    $npc.GenPronoun walks back scared and wodering what you will do to $npc.pronoun.
<<elseif $npc.hasPenis && $npc.lust gte 30 && $npc.fear lt 25>>\
    <<set $npc.aroused = true>>\
    $npc.GenPronoun looks at you with expectancy. <<if $npc.haveClothes>>@@color:deeppink;You can see a bump on his pants@@.<<else>>@@color:deeppink;He's already erected@@. <<emoji ❤>><</if>>
    (High lust made $npc.pronoun "happy" to see you)
<<elseif $npc.lust gte 50 && $npc.fear lt 25>>
    <<set $npc.aroused = true>>\
    $npc.GenPronoun looks at you with expectancy. <<if !$npc.haveClothes>>@@color:deeppink;$npc.Possessive pussy is wet and leaking@@. <<emoji ❤>><</if>>
    (High lust made $npc.pronoun "happy" to see you)
<<else>>\
    $npc.GenPronoun nervously looks at you with $npc.possessive $npc.eyeColor eyes.
<</if>>